[en.FOCUS_C18_000_STUDY_ABROAD]
Sponsored Oversea Education

[en.FOCUS_C18_000_STUDY_ABROAD_desc]
Though the Kirins have accumulated wisdom from thousands of years of reincarnation, we should not forget: other creatures in the world also have their own thousands of years of wisdom.\nWe should learn from them, and use the opportunity of opening up to go out of our own small circle, go to the world, and learn the wisdom of other creatures.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_STUDY_ABROAD]
公派留学

[zh.FOCUS_C18_000_STUDY_ABROAD_desc]
虽然麒麟族拥有着上千年轮回积累下来的智慧，但我们不要忘记：世界上的其他生物也有着属于它们自己的上千年智慧。\n师夷长技以自强，麒麟们应该利用如今开放的契机，走出自己的小圈子，走向世界，学习其他生物的智慧。

